    "title": "Demuth and Klobuchar clash in MN governor race",
    "text": "Demuth and Klobuchar clash in MN governor race\nThe Minnesota governor's race is heating up as the parents of a 10-year-old girl killed in the Annunciation shooting accuse candidate Lisa Demuth of blocking key gun control legislation. Jackie Flavin and Mike Moyski, campaigning alongside Amy Klobuchar, say Demuth broke her promise to allow a floor vote on an assault-style weapons ban. Demuth defended her record during a recent televised debate, pointing to alternative school safety measures her campaign supported.",
